<title>UK: BSG fin director off work through illness.</title>
<headline>BSG fin director off work through illness.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BSG International said on Monday finance director Peter Turnbull will be away from the office because of illness for some two to three months.</p>
<p>The company said that in his absence, his responsibilities would be assumed temporarily by Ray Thorne, corporate development director.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
